{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18775","headline":"调瑟词 · 刘禹锡","name":"调瑟词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"调瑟在张弦，弦平音自足。\n朱弦二十五，缺一不成曲。\n美人爱高张，瑶轸再三促。\n上弦虽独响，下应不相属。\n日暮声未和，寂寥一枯木。\n却顾膝上弦，流泪难相续。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18775.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18775","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}